nodes.body:
@hnyls2002 could you take a look? This changes the decoder bounded replay code you added in #38798. The last 128 tokens now start at layer 20 instead of layer 21, and layer 20 only writes its compressed KV cache for the earlier tokens.

The one thing I would like your opinion on: layer 20 now uses the same shortened sliding window as layers 21 to 39 for those 128 tokens. I chose this because it matches the DeepSeek-V4.1 report. Keeping the full window for layer 20 is also possible if you prefer it.

cc @Oasis-Git since this is under the bounded replay section of #42170.

